                <mxCell id="legend_notation" parent="legend" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Keys only:&lt;/b&gt; this page shows PK and FK columns; see erd-&amp;lt;domain&amp;gt;.drawio for all columns&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key · &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; unique · &lt;b&gt;IX&lt;/b&gt; indexed (non-FK)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GFK&lt;/b&gt; object-id half of a generic (polymorphic) FK – target table varies per row&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⟨enum⟩&lt;/b&gt; column restricted to choices (listed in the Enums box)&lt;br&gt;Italic brown rows: composite &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;CK&lt;/b&gt; check / &lt;b&gt;IX&lt;/b&gt; index constraints&lt;br&gt;Dashed grey-titled table = reference stub; full definition is in the file named in it&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;created_by_id / updated_by_id&lt;/b&gt; are FKs to users_customuser on almost every table. They are listed as FK columns but their lines are NOT drawn." vertex="1">
